      "claim": "Multiple lipophilic heteroaryl amides with CF3 or OCF3 motifs show high permeability in L4: HSGN-238 Papp 82.3 times 10^-6 cm/s, netupitant above 20 times 10^-6 cm/s, sorafenib high, vismodegib high permeability BCS class II, and DNDI-VL-2098 high with efflux ratio 1.1.",
